{
    "title": "Goods Puzzle: Sort Challenge",
    "description": "Get ready to embark on an exciting matching adventure like never before in <b>Goods Sorting: Match 3 Puzzle!</b> This Pair matching puzzle game offers a unique twist on the classic match 3 genre, combining strategic sorting, and rearranged challenges with thrilling puzzle gameplay.\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURES:</b>\r\n\u2728 Challenging Sorting Gameplay: Dive into a world of goods and engage in addictive sorting puzzles. Swap and match 3 or more identical goods to clear them from the board & earn points.\r\n\u2728 Unique Goods and Abilities: Encounter a wide variety of goods with different properties & special abilities. Some goods may explode, while others can clear entire rows or columns. Strategize your moves to make the most of these abilities and create powerful combos.\r\n\u2728 Exciting Power-Ups and Boosters: Unlock & use a range of power-ups & boosters to enhance your sorting abilities. These useful tools can help you overcome obstacles, clear difficult levels & achieve high scores.\r\n\u2728 Engaging Levels & Stories: Explore different stories on this 3D sorting adventure, each with its own set of challenging levels. From bustling marketplaces to serene gardens, the visually stunning environments will keep you captivated.\r\n\u2728 Obstacles and Limited Moves: Face various obstacles and limited moves as you progress through the game. Plan your moves carefully and strategize to overcome these challenges and complete objectives within the given limit.\r\n\r\n<b>HOW TO PLAY:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfae Swap & rearrange adjacent goods to create matches of 3.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Match 3 goods to create powerful combos & earn bonus points.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Utilize the special abilities of certain goods to your advantage.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Use power-ups and boosters strategically to overcome obstacles & clear levels.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Achieve high scores & complete objectives to progress through the game & unlock new levels & stories.\r\n\r\nEmbark on this sorting adventure & challenge yourself with the unique gameplay of <b>Goods Sorting: Pair Matching Puzzle</b>. Get ready to sort, match, rearrange & conquer the exciting puzzles that await you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready to embark on an exciting matching adventure like never before in <b>Goods Sorting: Match 3 Puzzle!</b> This Pair matching puzzle game offers a unique twist on the classic match 3 genre, combining strategic sorting, and rearranged challenges with thrilling puzzle gameplay.<br><br><b>FEATURES:</b><br>\u2728 Challenging Sorting Gameplay: Dive into a world of goods and engage in addictive sorting puzzles. Swap and match 3 or more identical goods to clear them from the board &amp; earn points.<br>\u2728 Unique Goods and Abilities: Encounter a wide variety of goods with different properties &amp; special abilities. Some goods may explode, while others can clear entire rows or columns. Strategize your moves to make the most of these abilities and create powerful combos.<br>\u2728 Exciting Power-Ups and Boosters: Unlock &amp; use a range of power-ups &amp; boosters to enhance your sorting abilities. These useful tools can help you overcome obstacles, clear difficult levels &amp; achieve high scores.<br>\u2728 Engaging Levels &amp; Stories: Explore different stories on this 3D sorting adventure, each with its own set of challenging levels. From bustling marketplaces to serene gardens, the visually stunning environments will keep you captivated.<br>\u2728 Obstacles and Limited Moves: Face various obstacles and limited moves as you progress through the game. Plan your moves carefully and strategize to overcome these challenges and complete objectives within the given limit.<br><br><b>HOW TO PLAY:</b><br>\ud83c\udfae Swap &amp; rearrange adjacent goods to create matches of 3.<br>\ud83c\udfae Match 3 goods to create powerful combos &amp; earn bonus points.<br>\ud83c\udfae Utilize the special abilities of certain goods to your advantage.<br>\ud83c\udfae Use power-ups and boosters strategically to overcome obstacles &amp; clear levels.<br>\ud83c\udfae Achieve high scores &amp; complete objectives to progress through the game &amp; unlock new levels &amp; stories.<br><br>Embark on this sorting adventure &amp; challenge yourself with the unique gameplay of <b>Goods Sorting: Pair Matching Puzzle</b>. Get ready to sort, match, rearrange &amp; conquer the exciting puzzles that await you!",
